# The games this launcher offers, in rail order. One game per non-comment
# line: <port directory name> | <display name>
#
# The launcher reads THIS file instead of scanning the tree, so the rail shows
# exactly what is listed here, in this order, nothing else. Port directories
# that exist on disk but are not listed simply do not appear.
#
#   banjokazooie-recomp | Banjo-Kazooie
#   banjotooie-recomp   | Banjo-Tooie
banjokazooie-recomp | Banjo-Kazooie
banjotooie-recomp | Banjo-Tooie

1.mcla-recomp | Midnight Club: Los Angeles
daytona-recomp | Daytona USA
outrun-recomp | OutRun Online Arcade
afterburnerclimax-recomp | After Burner Climax
alienbreed-recomp | Alien Breed: Evolution
alienbreed1-recomp | Alien Breed 1
burnoutrevenge-recomp | Burnout Revenge
crazytaxi-recomp | Crazy Taxi
geometrywars-recomp | Geometry Wars: Retro Evolved
geometrywars2-recomp | Geometry Wars: Retro Evolved 2
geometrywars3-recomp | Geometry Wars 3: Dimensions
hydrothunder-recomp | Hydro Thunder Hurricane
pgr4-recomp | Project Gotham Racing 4
